{"module":"before-race","voice":"male","duration":486.8,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"Before race: where the fear came from","start":0.0,"end":2.6,"words":[[0.05,0.38],[0.38,0.8],[1.09,1.34],[1.34,1.5],[1.5,1.75],[1.75,2.08],[2.08,2.41]]},{"el":"intro","text":"People often ask why the targeting of Black, Brown and Native people has lasted so long, and whether some forgotten origin explains it.","start":3.4,"end":12.87,"words":[[3.44,3.85],[3.85,4.17],[4.17,4.41],[4.41,4.65],[4.65,4.82],[4.82,5.38],[5.38,5.55],[5.55,5.95],[6.23,6.64],[6.64,6.88],[6.88,7.37],[7.37,7.77],[7.77,8.01],[8.01,8.5],[8.5,8.74],[8.74,9.07],[9.35,9.59],[9.59,9.92],[9.92,10.16],[10.16,10.73],[10.73,11.29],[11.29,12.02],[12.02,12.26]]},{"el":"intro","text":"The record gives a clearer answer: modern race is recent, it was written into law on purpose, and it has been defended by whatever argument was handy, including scripture and science.","start":13.22,"end":25.1,"words":[[13.27,13.42],[13.42,13.8],[13.8,14.09],[14.09,14.24],[14.24,14.69],[14.69,15.06],[15.32,15.7],[15.7,15.99],[15.99,16.14],[16.14,16.66],[16.93,17.07],[17.07,17.3],[17.3,17.67],[17.67,17.97],[17.97,18.12],[18.12,18.27],[18.27,18.71],[18.97,19.2],[19.2,19.35],[19.35,19.57],[19.57,19.79],[19.79,20.39],[20.39,20.61],[20.61,21.06],[21.06,21.66],[21.66,21.88],[21.88,22.33],[22.59,23.18],[23.18,23.78],[23.78,24.0],[24.0,24.53]]},{"el":"h0","text":"The ancient world sorted people differently","start":25.45,"end":28.32,"words":[[25.5,25.66],[25.66,26.23],[26.23,26.56],[26.56,26.97],[26.97,27.37],[27.37,28.11]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Slavery is ancient, but for most of history it was not based on skin color.","start":29.02,"end":34.71,"words":[[29.07,29.7],[29.7,29.85],[29.85,30.48],[30.75,30.99],[30.99,31.15],[31.15,31.54],[31.54,31.69],[31.69,32.24],[32.24,32.4],[32.4,32.64],[32.64,32.87],[32.87,33.26],[33.26,33.42],[33.42,33.73],[33.73,34.12]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Greeks, Romans, Egyptians, Africans, Arabs and Europeans enslaved people taken in war, sold for debt, or born to enslaved mothers, and enslaved people came from every region.","start":35.06,"end":48.85,"words":[[35.14,35.61],[35.89,36.53],[36.81,37.6],[37.88,38.59],[38.87,39.27],[39.27,39.51],[39.51,40.3],[40.3,40.93],[40.93,41.33],[41.33,41.81],[41.81,41.97],[41.97,42.21],[42.48,42.88],[42.88,43.04],[43.04,43.36],[43.63,43.71],[43.71,43.95],[43.95,44.11],[44.11,44.75],[44.75,45.22],[45.5,45.74],[45.74,46.37],[46.37,46.77],[46.77,47.09],[47.09,47.41],[47.41,47.72],[47.72,48.28]]},{"el":"s0","text":"The English word slave itself comes from Slav, because so many Eastern Europeans were enslaved in the Middle Ages.","start":49.2,"end":56.84,"words":[[49.24,49.4],[49.4,49.86],[49.86,50.1],[50.1,50.49],[50.49,50.95],[50.95,51.26],[51.26,51.58],[51.58,51.97],[52.24,52.63],[52.63,52.86],[52.86,53.17],[53.17,53.56],[53.56,54.34],[54.34,54.5],[54.5,55.12],[55.12,55.27],[55.27,55.43],[55.43,55.82],[55.82,56.36]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Historian Frank Snowden showed that Greek and Roman writers described Africans with curiosity and sometimes admiration, without the idea of a fixed racial ranking.","start":57.19,"end":68.27,"words":[[57.24,57.91],[57.91,58.29],[58.29,58.81],[58.81,59.11],[59.11,59.34],[59.34,59.64],[59.64,59.86],[59.86,60.31],[60.31,60.76],[60.76,61.44],[61.44,62.04],[62.04,62.26],[62.26,63.16],[63.16,63.39],[63.39,63.99],[63.99,64.81],[65.08,65.53],[65.53,65.68],[65.68,66.05],[66.05,66.2],[66.2,66.35],[66.35,66.73],[66.73,67.18],[67.18,67.7]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Race was written into law (1452–1705)","start":69.17,"end":73.38,"words":[[69.21,69.53],[69.53,69.77],[69.77,70.18],[70.18,70.51],[70.51,70.67],[70.67,72.94]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The idea that some people are naturally meant to be owned was spelled out step by step:","start":74.08,"end":80.25,"words":[[74.12,74.3],[74.3,74.75],[74.75,75.01],[75.01,75.28],[75.28,75.73],[75.73,75.82],[75.82,76.62],[76.62,76.98],[76.98,77.16],[77.16,77.33],[77.33,77.69],[77.69,77.96],[77.96,78.41],[78.41,78.67],[78.67,79.03],[79.03,79.3],[79.3,79.74]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1452–1455: Pope Nicholas V's bulls Dum Diversas and Romanus Pontifex authorized Portugal's king to conquer “Saracens and pagans” and reduce them to perpetual slavery.","start":80.6,"end":96.33,"words":[[80.62,83.35],[83.68,84.05],[84.05,84.71],[84.71,85.0],[85.0,85.37],[85.37,85.65],[85.65,86.41],[86.41,86.69],[86.69,87.44],[87.44,88.39],[88.39,89.14],[89.14,89.99],[89.99,90.27],[90.27,90.46],[90.46,90.93],[90.93,91.68],[91.68,91.97],[91.97,92.62],[92.62,92.91],[92.91,93.47],[93.47,93.76],[93.76,93.94],[93.94,94.79],[94.79,95.64]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Portugal's African slave trade grew under them.","start":96.68,"end":99.58,"words":[[96.71,97.27],[97.27,97.71],[97.71,98.02],[98.02,98.33],[98.33,98.52],[98.52,98.77],[98.77,99.02]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1493: Inter caetera gave Spain lands “discovered” in the Americas.","start":99.93,"end":105.4,"words":[[99.98,101.12],[101.39,101.69],[101.69,102.15],[102.15,102.45],[102.45,102.84],[102.84,103.22],[103.22,103.83],[103.83,103.98],[103.98,104.13],[104.13,104.82]]},{"el":"s1","text":"These bulls became the Doctrine of Discovery, which the U.S. Supreme Court adopted in Johnson v. M'Intosh (1823) to deny Native nations full ownership of their land.","start":105.75,"end":117.82,"words":[[105.8,106.03],[106.03,106.33],[106.33,106.78],[106.78,106.94],[106.94,107.47],[107.47,107.62],[107.62,108.38],[108.64,108.95],[108.95,109.1],[109.1,109.48],[109.86,110.31],[110.31,110.54],[110.54,111.07],[111.07,111.23],[111.23,111.76],[111.76,111.98],[112.36,112.9],[112.9,113.96],[114.22,114.38],[114.38,114.76],[114.76,115.21],[115.21,115.74],[115.74,115.97],[115.97,116.5],[116.5,116.65],[116.65,116.88],[116.88,117.26]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Vatican repudiated the doctrine in 2023.","start":118.17,"end":121.85,"words":[[118.21,118.34],[118.34,118.79],[118.79,119.62],[119.62,119.75],[119.75,120.2],[120.2,120.33],[120.33,121.35]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Supreme Court has not.","start":122.2,"end":124.07,"words":[[122.25,122.39],[122.39,122.81],[122.81,123.03],[123.03,123.24],[123.24,123.52]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1662: Virginia ruled that a child follows the condition of the mother, so children of enslaved women, including children of their enslavers, were born enslaved.","start":124.42,"end":136.18,"words":[[124.43,125.62],[125.88,126.48],[126.48,126.78],[126.78,127.0],[127.0,127.15],[127.15,127.6],[127.6,128.05],[128.05,128.2],[128.2,128.79],[128.79,128.94],[128.94,129.09],[129.09,129.46],[129.72,129.95],[129.95,130.54],[130.54,130.69],[130.69,131.29],[131.29,131.74],[132.0,132.59],[132.59,133.19],[133.19,133.34],[133.34,133.56],[133.56,134.31],[134.57,134.72],[134.72,134.94],[134.94,135.61]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1667–1705: Virginia declared that baptism does not free a slave (1667), that killing an enslaved person during “correction” was not a felony (1669), banned interracial marriage (1691), and gathered everything into the 1705 slave codes.","start":136.53,"end":157.93,"words":[[136.57,139.33],[139.61,140.24],[140.24,140.79],[140.79,141.03],[141.03,141.66],[141.66,141.89],[141.89,142.13],[142.13,142.37],[142.37,142.53],[142.53,142.92],[142.92,144.42],[144.69,144.93],[144.93,145.32],[145.32,145.48],[145.48,146.11],[146.11,146.51],[146.51,147.06],[147.06,147.69],[147.69,147.93],[147.93,148.16],[148.16,148.32],[148.32,148.79],[148.79,150.21],[150.49,150.8],[150.8,151.59],[151.59,152.07],[152.07,153.41],[153.68,153.92],[153.92,154.31],[154.31,154.87],[154.87,155.18],[155.18,155.34],[155.34,156.44],[156.44,156.84],[156.84,157.31]]},{"el":"s1","text":"France's Code Noir (1685) did the same for its colonies.","start":158.28,"end":163.16,"words":[[158.31,158.85],[158.85,159.16],[159.16,159.4],[159.4,160.56],[160.83,161.07],[161.07,161.22],[161.22,161.53],[161.53,161.69],[161.69,161.92],[161.92,162.54]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Dividing people who might unite","start":164.06,"end":166.1,"words":[[164.12,164.68],[164.68,165.03],[165.03,165.18],[165.18,165.46],[165.46,165.88]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In 1676, Bacon's Rebellion brought white indentured servants and enslaved Africans together in an armed revolt against Virginia's government.","start":166.8,"end":176.78,"words":[[166.85,167.0],[167.0,168.39],[168.65,169.16],[169.16,169.75],[169.75,170.04],[170.04,170.33],[170.33,170.99],[170.99,171.51],[171.51,171.73],[171.73,172.31],[172.31,172.9],[172.9,173.34],[173.34,173.49],[173.49,173.63],[173.63,173.85],[173.85,174.37],[174.37,174.81],[174.81,175.47],[175.47,176.2]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In the decades that followed, Virginia's laws gave poor white people small privileges (freedom dues, the right to bear arms, the right to strike a Black person) while taking rights away from all Black people, free or enslaved.","start":177.13,"end":192.52,"words":[[177.18,177.35],[177.35,177.51],[177.51,178.08],[178.08,178.33],[178.33,178.9],[179.18,179.92],[179.92,180.16],[180.16,180.49],[180.49,180.73],[180.73,181.06],[181.06,181.46],[181.46,181.79],[181.79,182.69],[182.69,183.18],[183.18,183.58],[183.87,184.03],[184.03,184.36],[184.36,184.52],[184.52,184.77],[184.77,185.09],[185.38,185.54],[185.54,185.87],[185.87,186.03],[186.03,186.52],[186.52,186.68],[186.68,187.01],[187.01,187.42],[187.7,188.03],[188.03,188.52],[188.52,188.93],[188.93,189.25],[189.25,189.58],[189.58,189.74],[189.74,190.07],[190.07,190.56],[190.84,191.09],[191.09,191.17],[191.17,191.9]]},{"el":"s2","text":"That the laws changed is documented.","start":192.87,"end":195.39,"words":[[192.91,193.1],[193.1,193.24],[193.24,193.43],[193.43,193.96],[193.96,194.09],[194.09,194.88]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Historian Edmund Morgan argued that the elite used race on purpose to keep poor white and Black people from uniting again.","start":195.74,"end":204.98,"words":[[195.79,196.64],[196.64,197.21],[197.21,197.68],[197.68,198.16],[198.16,198.44],[198.44,198.63],[198.63,199.01],[199.01,199.39],[199.39,199.77],[199.77,199.96],[199.96,200.43],[200.43,200.62],[200.62,200.91],[200.91,201.19],[201.19,201.57],[201.57,201.86],[201.86,202.24],[202.24,202.71],[202.71,203.09],[203.09,203.85],[203.85,204.32]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Others think the shift had more to do with the falling cost of enslaved Africans compared with English servants.","start":205.33,"end":211.84,"words":[[205.38,205.68],[205.68,205.98],[205.98,206.13],[206.13,206.43],[206.43,206.65],[206.65,206.8],[206.8,206.95],[206.95,207.1],[207.1,207.33],[207.33,207.48],[207.48,207.85],[207.85,208.15],[208.15,208.3],[208.3,208.9],[208.9,209.5],[209.5,210.02],[210.02,210.25],[210.25,210.7],[210.7,211.3]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Most agree the effect was the same.","start":212.19,"end":214.69,"words":[[212.24,212.62],[212.62,212.92],[212.92,213.07],[213.07,213.45],[213.45,213.68],[213.68,213.83],[213.83,214.21]]},{"el":"h3","text":"The practice came first, the ideas followed","start":215.59,"end":219.28,"words":[[215.63,215.82],[215.82,216.5],[216.5,216.89],[216.89,217.38],[217.72,217.91],[217.91,218.5],[218.5,219.08]]},{"el":"s3","text":"In 1944 the Trinidadian historian Eric Williams wrote that “slavery was not born of racism: rather, racism was the consequence of slavery.”","start":219.98,"end":230.3,"words":[[220.02,220.17],[220.17,221.14],[221.14,221.29],[221.29,222.19],[222.19,222.86],[222.86,223.16],[223.16,223.68],[223.68,223.98],[223.98,224.21],[224.21,224.81],[224.81,225.03],[225.03,225.25],[225.25,225.48],[225.48,225.63],[225.63,226.3],[226.56,226.94],[227.2,227.8],[227.8,228.02],[228.02,228.17],[228.17,228.92],[228.92,229.07],[229.07,229.74]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Ibram X. Kendi's Stamped from the Beginning (2016) traces the same pattern over five centuries: racist ideas were developed to defend policies that were already profitable.","start":230.65,"end":242.47,"words":[[230.69,231.05],[231.05,231.34],[231.7,232.14],[232.14,232.57],[232.57,232.86],[232.86,233.01],[233.01,233.52],[233.52,234.46],[234.71,235.22],[235.22,235.36],[235.36,235.65],[235.65,236.02],[236.02,236.31],[236.31,236.6],[236.6,237.32],[237.57,238.08],[238.08,238.52],[238.52,238.66],[238.66,239.24],[239.24,239.39],[239.39,239.82],[239.82,240.33],[240.33,240.54],[240.54,240.69],[240.69,241.12],[241.12,241.92]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Thomas Jefferson, who enslaved more than 600 people over his life, offered Black inferiority “as a suspicion only” in his Notes on the State of Virginia (1785).","start":242.82,"end":254.42,"words":[[242.88,243.25],[243.25,243.92],[244.17,244.32],[244.32,244.91],[244.91,245.06],[245.06,245.28],[245.28,246.1],[246.1,246.47],[246.47,246.76],[246.76,246.99],[246.99,247.36],[247.62,247.91],[247.91,248.21],[248.21,249.17],[249.17,249.32],[249.32,249.47],[249.47,250.06],[250.06,250.43],[250.43,250.58],[250.58,250.8],[250.8,251.17],[251.17,251.32],[251.32,251.46],[251.46,251.83],[251.83,251.98],[251.98,252.58],[252.58,253.83]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Within decades, “scientists” were measuring skulls to prove it (see the module on science).","start":254.77,"end":260.77,"words":[[254.82,255.22],[255.22,255.85],[256.13,256.93],[256.93,257.08],[257.08,257.64],[257.64,258.04],[258.04,258.2],[258.2,258.52],[258.52,258.68],[258.68,258.83],[258.83,258.99],[258.99,259.47],[259.47,259.63],[259.63,260.19]]},{"el":"h4","text":"What the fear was really about","start":261.67,"end":263.84,"words":[[261.72,262.0],[262.0,262.18],[262.18,262.45],[262.45,262.73],[262.73,263.19],[263.19,263.65]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The fear was real.","start":264.54,"end":265.69,"words":[[264.58,264.69],[264.69,264.86],[264.86,265.02],[265.02,265.3]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It was fear of revolt, of revenge, and of losing power at the ballot box:","start":266.04,"end":272.51,"words":[[266.09,266.28],[266.28,266.56],[266.56,266.83],[266.83,267.02],[267.02,267.76],[268.09,268.28],[268.28,269.02],[269.35,269.63],[269.63,269.81],[269.81,270.28],[270.28,270.65],[270.65,270.83],[270.83,271.02],[271.02,271.49],[271.49,271.95]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Haiti, 1791–1804: enslaved people overthrew French rule and founded the first free Black republic.","start":272.86,"end":280.55,"words":[[272.89,273.3],[273.54,275.55],[275.79,276.34],[276.34,276.69],[276.69,277.17],[277.17,277.59],[277.59,277.79],[277.79,278.0],[278.0,278.48],[278.48,278.62],[278.62,278.9],[278.9,279.11],[279.11,279.38],[279.38,280.0]]},{"el":"s4","text":"France later forced Haiti to pay 150 million francs (reduced to 90 million) for its own freedom, a debt Haiti paid off over about 120 years.","start":280.9,"end":290.59,"words":[[280.92,281.25],[281.25,281.57],[281.57,281.82],[281.82,282.15],[282.15,282.27],[282.27,282.47],[282.47,283.56],[283.56,283.95],[283.95,284.33],[284.33,284.78],[284.78,284.91],[284.91,285.3],[285.3,285.68],[285.91,286.04],[286.04,286.23],[286.23,286.42],[286.42,286.87],[287.1,287.22],[287.22,287.42],[287.42,287.74],[287.74,288.0],[288.0,288.12],[288.12,288.38],[288.38,288.7],[288.7,289.86],[289.86,290.18]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Nat Turner's rebellion, 1831: afterward, Virginia and other states tightened bans on teaching Black people to read and on Black preachers and gatherings.","start":290.94,"end":300.18,"words":[[290.99,291.19],[291.19,291.52],[291.52,292.12],[292.36,293.23],[293.46,293.99],[294.23,294.76],[294.76,294.96],[294.96,295.16],[295.16,295.57],[295.57,296.03],[296.03,296.3],[296.3,296.43],[296.43,296.84],[296.84,297.1],[297.1,297.44],[297.44,297.57],[297.57,297.77],[297.77,297.97],[297.97,298.11],[298.11,298.37],[298.37,298.84],[298.84,299.04],[299.04,299.64]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Reconstruction, 1867–1877: Black men voted and held office, and South Carolina's lower house had a Black majority.","start":300.53,"end":310.5,"words":[[300.63,301.63],[301.89,304.47],[304.72,305.01],[305.01,305.22],[305.22,305.66],[305.66,305.87],[305.87,306.16],[306.16,306.52],[306.77,306.98],[306.98,307.27],[307.27,307.99],[307.99,308.28],[308.28,308.56],[308.56,308.78],[308.78,308.92],[308.92,309.21],[309.21,309.93]]},{"el":"s4","text":"White-supremacist violence ended it, including the 1898 coup in Wilmington, North Carolina, where an elected biracial government was overthrown by force.","start":310.85,"end":322.85,"words":[[310.9,312.09],[312.09,312.72],[312.72,313.11],[313.11,313.35],[313.63,314.26],[314.26,314.42],[314.42,315.6],[315.6,315.84],[315.84,316.0],[316.0,316.79],[317.06,317.3],[317.3,318.09],[318.37,318.61],[318.61,318.76],[318.76,319.32],[319.32,320.03],[320.03,320.74],[320.74,320.98],[320.98,321.69],[321.69,321.92],[321.92,322.24]]},{"el":"s4","text":"“Replacement”: Madison Grant's The Passing of the Great Race (1916) warned that white Americans were being outbred.","start":323.2,"end":330.76,"words":[[323.24,324.08],[324.32,324.8],[324.8,325.22],[325.22,325.35],[325.35,325.7],[325.7,325.84],[325.84,325.98],[325.98,326.32],[326.32,326.6],[326.6,327.57],[327.81,328.09],[328.09,328.3],[328.3,328.57],[328.57,329.19],[329.19,329.33],[329.33,329.68],[329.68,330.23]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It helped pass the 1924 immigration quotas.","start":331.11,"end":334.82,"words":[[331.16,331.3],[331.3,331.65],[331.65,331.86],[331.86,332.0],[332.0,333.03],[333.03,333.73],[333.73,334.28]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The same fear, renamed the “Great Replacement,” was cited by the killers in El Paso (2019) and Buffalo (2022).","start":335.17,"end":344.49,"words":[[335.21,335.37],[335.37,335.69],[335.69,336.01],[336.29,336.85],[336.85,337.01],[337.01,337.41],[337.41,338.37],[338.37,338.61],[338.61,339.09],[339.09,339.33],[339.33,339.49],[339.49,339.89],[339.89,340.05],[340.05,340.21],[340.21,340.61],[340.61,341.65],[341.93,342.17],[342.17,342.73],[342.73,343.93]]},{"el":"h5","text":"How scripture was used, and misused","start":345.39,"end":348.62,"words":[[345.43,345.71],[345.71,346.45],[346.45,346.72],[346.72,347.19],[347.51,347.79],[347.79,348.43]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Curse of Ham.”","start":349.32,"end":350.4,"words":[[349.36,349.47],[349.47,349.65],[349.65,349.76],[349.76,350.0]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In Genesis 9:20–27, Noah curses Canaan, Ham's son, to be a servant.","start":350.75,"end":356.99,"words":[[350.8,350.94],[350.94,351.5],[351.5,353.18],[353.43,353.71],[353.71,354.06],[354.06,354.48],[354.73,355.01],[355.01,355.29],[355.53,355.67],[355.67,355.81],[355.81,355.95],[355.95,356.44]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The text says nothing about skin color or Africa.","start":357.34,"end":360.82,"words":[[357.39,357.55],[357.55,357.95],[357.95,358.18],[358.18,358.58],[358.58,358.97],[358.97,359.29],[359.29,359.6],[359.6,359.68],[359.68,360.23]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Linking the curse to dark skin came much later and was spread by interpreters across several traditions.","start":361.17,"end":367.04,"words":[[361.22,361.62],[361.62,361.76],[361.76,361.96],[361.96,362.1],[362.1,362.3],[362.3,362.57],[362.57,362.84],[362.84,363.11],[363.11,363.45],[363.45,363.66],[363.66,363.86],[363.86,364.2],[364.2,364.4],[364.4,365.08],[365.08,365.42],[365.42,365.83],[365.83,366.5]]},{"el":"s5","text":"By the 1800s it was a standard pro-slavery argument in American pulpits.","start":367.39,"end":372.51,"words":[[367.43,367.63],[367.63,367.76],[367.76,368.6],[368.6,368.73],[368.73,368.93],[368.93,369.06],[369.06,369.51],[369.51,370.29],[370.29,370.81],[370.81,370.94],[370.94,371.46],[371.46,371.98]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Slave Bible.”","start":372.86,"end":374.64,"words":[[372.91,373.07],[373.07,373.48],[373.48,374.04]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In 1807 a British missionary society printed Select Parts of the Holy Bible, for the Use of the Negro Slaves.","start":374.99,"end":383.94,"words":[[375.03,375.2],[375.2,376.21],[376.21,376.38],[376.38,376.88],[376.88,377.56],[377.56,378.24],[378.24,378.83],[378.83,379.33],[379.33,379.67],[379.67,379.84],[379.84,380.01],[380.01,380.43],[380.43,381.02],[381.32,381.49],[381.49,381.66],[381.66,381.91],[381.91,382.08],[382.08,382.25],[382.25,382.75],[382.75,383.34]]},{"el":"s5","text":"It cut most of the Old Testament, including the Exodus story of freedom from slavery, and kept passages like “Servants, be obedient to them that are your masters.”","start":384.29,"end":396.1,"words":[[384.33,384.49],[384.49,384.73],[384.73,385.14],[385.14,385.3],[385.3,385.46],[385.46,385.79],[385.79,386.6],[386.88,387.53],[387.53,387.69],[387.69,388.26],[388.26,388.67],[388.67,388.83],[388.83,389.31],[389.31,389.64],[389.64,390.37],[390.65,390.9],[390.9,391.22],[391.22,391.87],[391.87,392.19],[392.19,392.84],[393.13,393.29],[393.29,394.02],[394.02,394.18],[394.18,394.42],[394.42,394.67],[394.67,394.75],[394.75,394.91],[394.91,395.48]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Scripture was also the strongest weapon against slavery: enslaved people sang of Moses and Exodus, and abolitionists from Frederick Douglass to the Black church built their case on it.","start":396.45,"end":407.65,"words":[[396.5,397.06],[397.06,397.27],[397.27,397.62],[397.62,397.76],[397.76,398.39],[398.39,398.74],[398.74,399.17],[399.17,399.8],[400.05,400.61],[400.61,400.96],[400.96,401.17],[401.17,401.31],[401.31,401.73],[401.73,401.94],[401.94,402.51],[402.75,402.96],[402.96,403.81],[403.81,404.09],[404.09,404.65],[404.65,405.07],[405.07,405.21],[405.21,405.35],[405.35,405.63],[405.63,405.98],[405.98,406.27],[406.27,406.48],[406.48,406.76],[406.76,406.9],[406.9,407.11]]},{"el":"h6","text":"The Book of Enoch and modern race myths","start":408.55,"end":411.12,"words":[[408.6,408.77],[408.77,409.02],[409.02,409.19],[409.19,409.53],[409.53,409.79],[409.79,410.21],[410.21,410.55],[410.55,410.89]]},{"el":"s6","text":"1 Enoch is an ancient Jewish book that is part of the Bible of the Ethiopian Orthodox Church; fragments were found among the Dead Sea Scrolls, and the Letter of Jude (verses 14–15) quotes it.","start":411.82,"end":424.45,"words":[[411.86,412.09],[412.09,412.4],[412.4,412.55],[412.55,412.7],[412.7,413.23],[413.23,413.61],[413.61,413.83],[413.83,414.06],[414.06,414.21],[414.21,414.44],[414.44,414.59],[414.59,414.74],[414.74,415.2],[415.2,415.35],[415.35,415.5],[415.5,416.26],[416.26,416.79],[416.79,417.24],[417.51,418.19],[418.19,418.34],[418.34,418.72],[418.72,419.02],[419.02,419.17],[419.17,419.4],[419.4,419.55],[419.55,420.16],[420.42,420.65],[420.65,420.8],[420.8,421.1],[421.1,421.26],[421.26,421.56],[421.56,421.94],[421.94,422.92],[423.19,423.64],[423.64,423.87]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It tells how angels called the Watchers came to earth, taught forbidden knowledge, and fathered giants (the Nephilim of Genesis 6).","start":424.8,"end":433.03,"words":[[424.85,425.0],[425.0,425.3],[425.3,425.53],[425.53,426.14],[426.14,426.44],[426.44,426.6],[426.6,427.05],[427.05,427.36],[427.36,427.51],[427.51,427.74],[428.0,428.23],[428.23,428.77],[428.77,429.3],[429.56,429.79],[429.79,430.17],[430.17,430.78],[430.78,430.93],[430.93,431.47],[431.47,431.62],[431.62,432.23],[432.23,432.61]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It contains no teaching about race.","start":433.38,"end":435.77,"words":[[433.43,433.55],[433.55,434.06],[434.06,434.24],[434.24,434.62],[434.62,434.94],[434.94,435.25]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Modern movements have still built race stories on Genesis and Enoch.","start":436.12,"end":440.49,"words":[[436.17,436.54],[436.54,437.14],[437.14,437.36],[437.36,437.66],[437.66,437.96],[437.96,438.25],[438.25,438.7],[438.7,438.85],[438.85,439.44],[439.44,439.67],[439.67,440.04]]},{"el":"s6","text":"We describe them so you can recognize them, not because they are true:","start":440.84,"end":445.83,"words":[[440.88,441.04],[441.04,441.71],[441.71,441.97],[441.97,442.22],[442.22,442.38],[442.38,442.64],[442.64,443.39],[443.39,443.73],[444.02,444.27],[444.27,444.69],[444.69,444.94],[444.94,445.03],[445.03,445.36]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Christian Identity “two-seedline” theology, a white-supremacist doctrine claiming Jews and people of color descend from the serpent or from “pre-Adamic” races.","start":446.18,"end":456.49,"words":[[446.23,446.83],[446.83,447.52],[447.52,448.2],[448.2,448.96],[449.22,449.38],[449.38,450.51],[450.51,451.04],[451.04,451.58],[451.58,451.88],[451.88,452.11],[452.11,452.49],[452.49,452.64],[452.64,452.94],[452.94,453.4],[453.4,453.7],[453.7,453.85],[453.85,454.31],[454.31,454.38],[454.38,454.69],[454.69,455.44],[455.44,455.98]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The Nation of Islam's story of Yakub, which teaches that a scientist named Yakub created white people thousands of years ago.","start":456.84,"end":464.89,"words":[[456.88,457.02],[457.02,457.46],[457.46,457.6],[457.6,458.04],[458.04,458.4],[458.4,458.55],[458.55,458.98],[459.24,459.53],[459.53,459.96],[459.96,460.18],[460.18,460.33],[460.33,460.98],[460.98,461.34],[461.34,461.71],[461.71,462.36],[462.36,462.65],[462.65,463.02],[463.02,463.6],[463.6,463.74],[463.74,464.03],[464.03,464.4]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Some Hebrew Israelite groups teach that Black, Hispanic and Native Americans are the true Israelites and that others are cursed.","start":465.24,"end":474.03,"words":[[465.28,465.54],[465.54,465.97],[465.97,466.73],[466.73,467.16],[467.16,467.5],[467.5,467.76],[467.76,468.18],[468.48,469.16],[469.16,469.42],[469.42,469.93],[469.93,470.7],[470.7,470.78],[470.78,470.96],[470.96,471.21],[471.21,472.06],[472.06,472.32],[472.32,472.58],[472.58,472.92],[472.92,473.0],[473.0,473.43]]},{"el":"s6","text":"These stories mirror each other: each claims race is ancient, fixed and cosmic.","start":474.38,"end":479.53,"words":[[474.42,474.64],[474.64,475.07],[475.07,475.36],[475.36,475.57],[475.57,475.86],[476.11,476.32],[476.32,476.75],[476.75,477.04],[477.04,477.18],[477.18,477.76],[478.01,478.37],[478.37,478.58],[478.58,479.08]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The historical record shows the opposite: race is recent, made by people, and can be unmade.","start":479.88,"end":485.93,"words":[[479.92,480.05],[480.05,480.72],[480.72,481.06],[481.06,481.33],[481.33,481.46],[481.46,481.93],[482.17,482.43],[482.43,482.57],[482.57,483.04],[483.27,483.54],[483.54,483.74],[483.74,484.15],[484.38,484.58],[484.58,484.78],[484.78,484.92],[484.92,485.39]]}]}